   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_dd5bd389fe0de61ae212",
   "sourceHash": "dd5bd389fe0de61ae212e09293004c0860f1d6313ca0c0a1c748b73f816a3a4b",
   "text": "禁烟政策是维持 Kairali 宁静且以健康为本的氛围不可或缺的一部分。吸烟会将毒素带入体内，扰乱身体的自然平衡（",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_745f1c6a2f85d5c5dd30",
   "sourceHash": "745f1c6a2f85d5c5dd301aaa8bba90f0ac93739f922cf2c3bd1a1d6f648b019a",
   "text": "远离吸烟有助于增强免疫系统、改善呼吸健康并促进思维清晰。这契合阿育吠陀关于身、心、灵平衡与和谐的理念。通过避免接触尼古丁等有害物质，身体可以重新找回其自然节律与活力。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_2aadf4f823a05241be35",
   "sourceHash": "2aadf4f823a05241be357a74e0b156bfac67c5942aeb39494e61673a7b7743c0",
   "text": "自然在 Kairali 疗愈中的作用",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_ac314d4f211c21c20e9f",
   "sourceHash": "ac314d4f211c21c20e9f31577bb1845db4ec93c45eb1f613615b62b0e6fb8771",
   "text": "阿育吠陀原则与吸烟的危害",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
  {
   "id": "t_5c7122b7a5c8700a2ae3",
   "sourceHash": "5c7122b7a5c8700a2ae3f95bfe5f34eabf0b12b2896f3ae0206b802653c859dd",
   "text": "遵循阿育吠陀原则，Kairali 认识到吸烟对身心的负面影响。吸烟会加重多沙失衡，表现为各种身心健康问题。此外，吸烟会造成依赖，降低思维清晰度，并导致倦怠乏力。",
   "status": "translated",
   "unchangedReason": null,
   "issues": []
  },
